Cresset, a multi-family office and wealth manager with over $235 billion in assets under management and advisement, has promoted Susie Cranston, current president of the firm, to CEO, effective April 15. Co-founders Avy Stein and Eric Becker will step down as co-CEOs but remain active as executive co-chairs of the firm. Cranston will join the firm’s board of directors.&nbsp;

